	(text "GPS-denied quadrotor flight controller, rev B (DRAFT UNTIL INDEPENDENT REVIEW)\n\nMCU: STM32H743VIT6, 480 MHz Cortex-M7, PX4 (NuttX). Pin map derived from Pixhawk FMUv6C.\nIMUs: ICM-45686 (SPI1, external 32 kHz clock) + BMI088 (SPI2). Baro: BMP581 (I2C4). IMU heater on an isolated island (rev B).\nStorage: microSD (SDMMC2) for logs, params and the RAPTOR policy.\nBuses: 2x CAN FD (TCAN1462V), TELEM1/TELEM2 with flow control, GPS/I2C, RC (CRSF), USB-C.\nMotors: M1-M4 on TIM1 (bidirectional DShot) via 8-pin ESC harness with telemetry and current; M5-M8 on AUX.\nPower: 2S-6S in, reverse-polarity FET, TVS, 5 V 3.5 A buck, ideal-diode USB backup, 3V3 buck, low-noise sensor LDO,\ncurrent-limited peripheral and CAN power.\nBoard: 38 x 38 mm, 30.5 mm M3 mount, 6-layer JLCPCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
